     NO PUBLISHED ARGUMENT REACHES THIS RANK -- there is nothing here to agree with. Petrov type I forbids a rank-2 tensor and says nothing above it; Owen-Yunes-Witek searched rank 2. Do not report this as corroborated.
     EXPECTED, NOT INDEPENDENT: the rank-3 Kerr Killing space above the floor is spanned by Carter times momenta, so Carter's death at rank 2 made this the strongly favoured outcome. Not a corollary -- for F0 = Q p_t the O(zeta) source is {H1,Q} p_t and its solution G1 need not factor as F1 p_t, so the obstruction sits in a larger space than rank 2's and the extra factor could have killed it. It did not.
